    "about": "<cite index=\"15-1\">Yearn Finance is a suite of products in Decentralized Finance (DeFi) that provides lending aggregation, yield generation, and insurance on the Ethereum blockchain.</cite> <cite index=\"30-7,30-8\">Yearn's V3 system is a decentralized suite of yield-generating products built to fit any need, designed to be un-opinionated and customizable infrastructure for the world to build on, making yield generation as safe, efficient, and easy as possible for all parties.</cite> The protocol operates through ERC4626-compliant vaults that allocate user deposits across strategies, with governance controlled by <cite index=\"3-10\">a 6 of 9 Gnosis Safe multisig.</cite>"
